    {
      "id": 493215,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2026-02-03T09:39:43.039Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/saumyaseelan_pv\">@Saumyaseelan_Pv</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mehrdadtf\">@mehrdadtf</a></p>\n<p>The asset movement does not update cost center in submitted asset record.</p>\n<p>You have to override it by setting property setter for allow on submit option for cost center field on asset header. The new depreciation jvs will capture updated cost center as soon as auto depreciation jvs are triggerd.</p>",
